Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: ExtDefList

    2 ExtDefList: ExtDef ExtDefList
    3           | ε

    4 ExtDef: Specifier ExtDecList SEMI
    5       | Specifier SEMI
    6       | Specifier FunDec CompSt
    7       | Specifier FunDec SEMI
    8       | error SEMI

    9 ExtDecList: VarDec
   10           | VarDec COMMA ExtDecList

   11 Specifier: INT
   12          | FLOAT
   13          | StructSpecifier

   14 StructSpecifier: STRUCT OptTag LC DefList RC
   15                | STRUCT Tag

   16 OptTag: ID
   17       | ε

   18 Tag: ID

   19 VarDec: ID
   20       | VarDec LB INT_CONST RB

   21 FunDec: ID LP VarList RP
   22       | ID LP RP

   23 VarList: ParamDec COMMA VarList
   24        | ParamDec

   25 ParamDec: Specifier VarDec

   26 CompSt: LC DefList StmtList RC

   27 StmtList: Stmt StmtList
   28         | ε

   29 Stmt: MatchedStmt
   30     | UnmatchedStmt

   31 MatchedStmt: Exp SEMI
   32            | CompSt
   33            | RETURN Exp SEMI
   34            | WHILE LP Exp RP MatchedStmt
   35            | IF LP Exp RP MatchedStmt ELSE MatchedStmt
   36            | error SEMI

   37 UnmatchedStmt: IF LP Exp RP Stmt
   38              | IF LP Exp RP MatchedStmt ELSE UnmatchedStmt
   39              | IF LP Exp RP error ELSE Stmt

   40 DefList: Def DefList
   41        | ε

   42 Def: Specifier DecList SEMI

   43 DecList: Dec
   44        | Dec COMMA DecList

   45 Dec: VarDec
   46    | VarDec ASSIGNOP Exp

   47 Exp: Exp ASSIGNOP Exp
   48    | Exp AND Exp
   49    | Exp OR Exp
   50    | Exp LT Exp
   51    | Exp LE Exp
   52    | Exp GT Exp
   53    | Exp GE Exp
   54    | Exp EQ Exp
